R scripts for conducting Approximate Bayesian Computation (ABC) on genotypic data

drawing_parameters - R script for generating .def files consisting of parameters defining historical scenarios for Fastsimcoal
ml_admixture_coeff - R script for computing maximum likelihood admixture coefficients for .str files
model_selection - R script for model selection with ABC package with multinomial logistic regression and neural network, and conducting cross-validation on scenarios
posterior_par_dist - R script for estimating posterior parameter distributions for the most selected scenario
postpred - R script for conducting posterior predictive check for the most selected scenario
